   "class": "ArticleParagraph_root__4mszW",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article",
    "section"
   ],
   "textLength": 458,
   "text": "I do not believe that the secret of the bomb should be given to the United Nations organization. I do not believe that it should be given to the Soviet Union. Either course would be like the action of a man with capital, who, wishing another man to work with him on some enterprise, should start out by simply giving his prospective partner half of his money. The second man might choose to start a r",
